{
  "_comment": "DESIGN.md \u00a77. Builder A complete: six units covering all four damage types (\u00a76.1). Tier 2 on every unit, tier 3 on three of them (\u00a77.3). Pricing aims at ~1.6x cost for ~2.2x value so going tall beats going wide, but needs board presence you already paid for. DESIGN CHANGE from \u00a75.2: moveSpeed is how fast a unit advances when nothing is in range; 0 pins it in place. `range` is reach measured EDGE TO EDGE, so a melee value near zero means walking up and touching rather than stopping a body-width short. `bodyRadius` is both collision and drawn size. All placeholders.",
